    {
      "key": "hn",
      "name": "Hacker News Agent",
      "description": "Scrape the Hacker News front page and get a topic-filtered digest written directly as Markdown — no separate formatting step.",
      "sourceId": "nodetool-base/Hacker News Agent",
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "comment-intro",
            "parent_id": null,
            "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
            "data": {
              "comment": "# 📰 Hacker News Agent\n\nAn agent scrapes the Hacker News front page, prioritizes posts matching your topic, and writes the digest straight to Markdown.\n\n**Pipeline:** Topic + instructions → HN agent (writes Markdown directly, no post-processing step) → output\n\n**Try this:** change the topic to steer coverage, or broaden it to cover the whole front page."
            },
            "ui_properties": {
              "selected": false,
              "position": {
                "x": 80,
                "y": -200
              },
              "zIndex": 0,
              "width": 460,
              "height": 180,
              "selectable": true
            },
            "dynamic_properties": {},
            "dynamic_outputs": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "topic_input",
            "parent_id": null,
            "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
            "data": {
              "name": "topic",
              "value": "AI and developer tools",
              "description": "Focus area for the digest. Posts matching this topic are prioritized; if none match, the agent falls back to the top general front-page posts."
            },
            "ui_properties": {
              "selected": false,
              "title": "1️⃣ Topic",
              "position": {
                "x": 80,
                "y": 300
              },
              "zIndex": 0,
              "width": 280,
              "selectable": true
            },
            "dynamic_properties": {},
            "dynamic_outputs": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "3",
            "parent_id": null,
            "type": "nodetool.agents.Agent",
            "data": {
              "model": {
                "type": "language_model",
                "provider": "openai",
                "id": "gpt-5-mini",
                "name": "GPT-5 mini",
                "path": null,
                "supported_tasks": []
              },
              "tools": [
                {
                  "type": "tool_name",
                  "name": "google_search"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tool_name",
                  "name": "browser"
                }
              ],
              "max_tokens": 100000,
              "prompt": "",
              "system": "You are a Hacker News analyst.\n\nGoal\n- Research the current Hacker News front page and write a single Markdown digest.\n- Use tools to gather real data — never invent posts, comments, or authors.\n\nTools Available\n- google_search: Search the web for information\n- browser: Navigate to URLs and extract page content\n\nWorkflow\n1. Open https://news.ycombinator.com/ and select the posts described in the task instructions (topic focus and count).\n2. For each selected post, open its discussion thread with the browser tool and extract the top comments.\n3. Write the final answer as Markdown text — one `##` heading per post, a link, and a bulleted comment list. Do not wrap the answer in JSON.\n\nOutput\n- Call the digest tool exactly once with the finished Markdown in the `digest_markdown` field.\n- Keep it scannable: a one-line overview at the top, then one section per post, no filler.\n"
            },
            "ui_properties": {
              "title": "2️⃣ Scrape & write digest",
              "position": {
                "x": 440,
                "y": 80
              },
              "zIndex": 0,
              "width": 280,
              "selectable": true
            },
            "dynamic_properties": {},
            "dynamic_outputs": {
              "digest_markdown": {
                "type": "str",
                "optional": false,
                "values": null,
                "type_args": [],
                "type_name": null
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "4",
            "parent_id": null,
            "type": "nodetool.text.Prompt",
            "data": {
              "prompt": "\nScrape the front page of https://news.ycombinator.com/ and write a themed Markdown digest.\n\nTopic focus: {{ topic }}\n- Prioritize front-page posts related to this topic.\n- If none match, cover the top general front-page posts instead and say so in the overview.\n\nTasks:\n1) Identify the top 5 relevant posts (topic matches first, then highest-ranked).\n2) For each post:\n   - Fetch the discussion thread with the browser tool.\n   - Extract the top 3 comments by score or prominence, with author and text.\n3) Write the final answer as Markdown with this structure:\n\n# Hacker News Digest: {{ topic }}\n\n<1-2 sentence overview of the themes across the selected posts>\n\n## <post title>\n<post url>\n\n**Top comments:**\n- **<author>:** <comment text>\n- **<author>:** <comment text>\n- **<author>:** <comment text>\n\n(repeat the \"## <post title>\" section once per post)\n"
            },
            "ui_properties": {
              "title": "1️⃣ Research instructions",
              "position": {
                "x": 80,
                "y": 80
              },
              "zIndex": 0,
              "width": 280,
              "selectable": true
